    "清理全部磁盘缓存？" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clear All Disk Cache?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点击复制按钮复制此地址，在 Finder 的“前往文件夹”中打开；也可在下方一键清理 Barclip 的全部文本、图片和文件暂存缓存。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copy this path to open the folder with Finder's Go to Folder, or clear all Barclip text, image, and file staging caches below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已清理全部磁盘缓存。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "All disk cache cleared."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "部分磁盘缓存清理失败，请重试。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some disk cache could not be cleared. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会删除 Barclip 中的全部文本、图片和文件暂存记录，但不会删除原文件，也不会重置其他设置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This removes all text, image, and staged file records from Barclip. Original files and other settings are not changed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍然退出" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
